        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This <em>+1 striking shortbow</em> is made from an oryx horn hollowed out and reinforced with bone and leather. When turned around, the bow acts as a large hunting horn whose blast can be heard through even the densest forests, up to 5 miles away.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Rallying Call</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (auditory)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You signal your allies to close in on your prey. Choose one enemy within 60 feet. You and allies within 5 miles are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Quickened] until the end of your next turn and can use the extra action only to Step or Stride toward the chosen enemy.</p>"
